## Actions
Found the two commits with `git log --oneline --name-status -- rules/`:
a416b36 (five files -> engineering.md) and 1745fbc (STE -> reporting.md plus
the technical-writing skill), both dated Jul 26 2026 about one minute apart.
Read both full diffs and both git notes.

Restored with `git checkout a416b36^ -- <six paths>` rather than `git revert`.
Deliberate: reverting 1745fbc would also have rolled plugin.json from 0.25.0
back to 0.22.0, since that commit carried a version bump and three later bumps
have landed since. A path checkout avoids that conflict entirely.

Then `git rm` on rules/engineering.md, rules/reporting.md, and
plugins/abatilo-core/skills/technical-writing/, and bumped abatilo-core
0.25.0 -> 0.26.0.

Verified the restore with `git diff a416b36^ -- <six paths>`, which came back
empty, and cross-checked line counts against the deletion stats in the two
commit messages. Both matched.

